  "id": 228,
  "title": "智慧园区是构建智慧城市的核心",
  "date": "2023-05-22",
  "summary": "",
  "abstract": null,
  "category": "公司动态",
  "href": "/information/detail-228.html",
  "image": "https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2023-5-22/20235221915372806.png",
  "author": "古河云科技",
  "content": "<section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><section style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px 7px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;letter-spacing:1.8px;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><p style=\"margin:5px 0;\"><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2023-5-22/20235221914502395.png\" title=\"凤凰山4\" alt=\"凤凰山4\" /><br /><br /><br /></span></p><p style=\"margin:5px 0;\"><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">随着城市智慧化建设进度加快，社区物业也在加快智慧化建设的步伐，业主关注程度较高的非社区安防问题莫属，加强社区治安综合治理现实意义凸显。</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">古河云</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">助力社区安防管理可视化平台建设，将各重要数据进行整合，结合</span> 2D<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">、</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;\">3D </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">可视化进行</span></span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">智慧园区</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">展示，让</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">智慧园区</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">安防智慧化水平进一步提升。</span></p><p style=\"margin:5px 0;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">古河云</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">对各子系统的数据进行整合，将社区的基本信息、停车场、物业人员、设备设施等主要信息结合</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">智慧园区</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">三维场景进行展示。通过</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">多样化的</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">交互可将三维场景视角聚焦到所选</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">的</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">园区</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">，同时概览数据细化至小区级别，方便用户对</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">智慧社区</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">概况快速了解。</span></p><p style=\"margin:5px 0;\"><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">在</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">智慧园区</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">内部，日常生活中使用大量的水，排水系统作为非常重要的组成部分，能够确保</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">智慧园区</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">内居民的正常用水，从而享受舒适的家居生活。</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">古河云</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">通过推出基于管线可视化的独特算法用于</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">智慧社区</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">内排水管网生成，并辅以流向动画，实现直观查看</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">智慧社区</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">内排水系统管道布局与走向。结合排水设备各项监测数据附于面板两侧，让用户对</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">智慧社区</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">排水情况一目了然。</span></p><p style=\"margin:5px 0;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">智慧园区的</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">室外消火栓是每个住宅小区都必须具备的基础消防设施，设置的数量应能保证每幢建筑都在其保护半径以内，位置应设在消防车道旁，</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">园区的</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">室外消防栓的保护半径不应超过</span> 150m<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">，间距不应超过</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"> 120m</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">，以便于消防车取水。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:5px 0;\"><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">当出现设备故障时，通过物联设备与</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px\">古河云</span><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:16px;font-family:宋体;\">可视化平台实时联动，示意消防存在隐患问题。用户将根据该预警提示，及时安排运维人员前往对应预警点位进行处理。</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:0;margin:5px 0;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:12px\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:calibri;font-size:14px\"> </span></p><p><br /></p></section></section>",
